            "content": "<p>We ship from Adelaide, South Australia to anywhere in Australia. <strong>In-stock</strong> orders placed before 2pm ACST on a business day leave the same day. Pre-orders ship when they land (see below).</p><p>Metro areas: 2–5 business days. Regional, WA, NT, TAS: 4–10 business days. Boats ship by freight: not charged at checkout, we quote and invoice it separately and book delivery with you.</p>"
